# Local Claude Code state: plan scaffolding (.claude/plans/), machine-specific
# settings, and any fingerprint files HCF writes alongside a plan. Plans are
# working scaffolding, not deliverables — this repo is the plugin itself and
# does not run HCF on itself.
#
# NOTE: this MUST stay as `.claude/*` (contents) rather than `.claude/` (the
# directory). Git cannot re-include a file underneath an excluded *directory*,
# so collapsing this to `.claude/` would silently untrack .claude/CLAUDE.md —
# this repo's own project config — with no warning. Verified behavior, not a
# guess. Use `git add -f` to track anything else under here.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Test harness scratch space. run-tests.sh clears this on entry and exit, but a
# suite that dies mid-run leaves it behind.
tests/.tmp/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Conflict and in-place-edit leftovers (git merge, `sed -i.bak`)
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
